      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.747 - In the narration of Zurarah from Imam Muhammad ibn Ali Al-Baqir (as), said:\n\"If there is a distance between her and him that is about the length of a step or about the length of a cubit or more, then there is no harm if She prays beside him alone.\""
        ]
